Requirements:
- Title: compelling, includes 'Long Island' or 'Plainview NY' or 'Nassau County'
- Intro paragraph (2-3 sentences, hook the reader)
- 3-4 body sections with H2 headings
- Local angle — mention Long Island, Nassau County, Plainview NY naturally
- CTA at the end (visit us, call us, shop online)
- Tone: friendly, local, helpful
- Include keywords: Long Island convenience store, Plainview NY, Nassau County, gift basket, same-day pickup

Respond in this exact JSON format (no markdown wrapper):
{
  "title": "Blog post title here",
  "slug": "url-friendly-slug-here",
  "meta_description": "155 char SEO meta description",
  "tags": ["Long Island", "Plainview NY", "tag3"],
  "html_body": "<h2>Section 1</h2><p>...</p><h2>Section 2</h2>...",
  "social_caption": "Short 200-char social media caption with emojis",
  "hashtags": ["LongIsland", "PlainviewNY", "NassauCounty"]
}"
    }
  ]
}

